# Roaming Throne doubles only abilities of ANOTHER creature you control of the chosen type (CR 603.2d). It names Wizard
# and is a Wizard itself, but its own Ward {2} triggers once when Bot2 Lightning Bolts it on turn 2: the Bolt and one ward
# trigger are on the stack. Bot2 has no mana left to pay {2}, so the Bolt is countered. On turn 3 Bot1's Baleful Strix, a
# Bird and no Wizard, enters: its "draw a card" triggers once.
# Bot1's hand: 7 - 5 cast or played on turn 1 = 2; turn 3 draws (3), casts the Strix (2), draws one for it: 3.

